  <text>
    <body>
      <conceptEntry id="dpp-0121">
      <languageSection xml:lang="eng">
          <descrip type="definition">
            <p>(abstract) representation of a set of instance assets with common characteristics and features</p>
          </descrip>
          <note type="note">The set of instance assets may exist or may not exist.</note>
          <note type="example">Examples of type assets are type of material, a product type, a type of a part, a device type, a machine type, a type of software, a type of control system, a type of production system.</note>
          <ref>IDTA-01001-3.2:2026 (Specification of the Asset Administration Shell — Part 1: Metamodel) 1.1.28</ref>
          <ref>IEC 63278-1:2023</ref>
      </languageSection>
      </conceptEntry>
    </body>
  </text>
</tbx>
